fa244-styles-5f7536dc-9dc1-4cfe-9034-f4819bf9da26-attributes-color:#2a2a2a" class="r-tf9f6v"><div data-rid="54c3c198-9c10-4f34-9ca1-c22a32321065" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-5f7536dc-9dc1-4cfe-9034-f4819bf9da26-attributes-color:#2a2a2a" class="r-1la19q"><div data-rid="7db5bde2-3eec-41a7-ab7d-12b1e9720236" class="r-uwteyk alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-5f7536dc-9dc1-4cfe-9034-f4819bf9da26-attributes-color:#2a2a2a"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Why are you suffering from painful cramps?&nbsp;</strong></p></span></div><div data-rid="c3ebe5cb-3b7b-4488-ae2f-d9641e3e54db" class="r-5rzd0r alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-2c318d14-1fc7-401a-9c5c-cbae2e3e47f0-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The difference between someone who experiences mild periods and someone who struggles with debilitating cramps often comes down to prostaglandins.<br></p><br><p>These hormone-like compounds control uterine contractions, but when they spike too high, they trigger stronger contractions, more inflammation, and more pain.<span style="color: rgb(42, 42, 42)">This cycle doesn’t just resolve on its own. And if the root cause isn’t addressed, the body keeps repeating the same pattern.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(42, 42, 42)">monthlies targets both the symptoms and the root cause </span><strong>to provide ease that’s predictable, lasting, and complete.</strong></p></span></div><button data-rid="4062a814-276f-4001-843b-7ee7592652da" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-1li7xmu alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-0ab587ea-fd60-4f22-8fd2-f48986733cd6-attributes-color-background-color:#8cbfbd"><div data-rid="a103ea5a-1613-4ba0-9145-acf59690da7f" class="r-mm3pys alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>TRY MONTHLIES NOW</p></span></div><div data-rid="5029745b-7277-4ea8-a95